                                                "sense_id": "e3f4b661-fc39-3648-919b-f4a053094e24",
                                                "text": "Japanese: 歴史 (れきし, rekishi)\nJeju: 역ᄉᆞ(歷史) (yeoksaw)\nKorean: 역사(歷史) (yeoksa) (South Korea), 력사(歷史) (ryeoksa) (North Korea)\nVietnamese: lịch sử (歷史)"
                                            }
                                        ]
